# Always loaded. One host per line; "*.example.com" matches example.com and all
# its subdomains. Lines starting with # are comments.

# The coding agents' hosts (Anthropic, OpenAI) are not here: the claude-code and
# codex add-ons allowlist them from their env files, so a sandbox only reaches the
# provider of the agent it runs.

# GitHub: git over https/ssh, API, release downloads, raw files
github.com
api.github.com
codeload.github.com
*.githubusercontent.com
